-------------------------
- Table 3/4 (static-audit prevalence, per-anchor CIs): scripts/run_static_audit.py,
  scripts/canonical_divergence.py -> data/results/STATIC-AUDIT-v2-RESULTS.md,
  CANONICAL-DIVERGENCE-RESULTS.md
- Table 5 (popularity stratification): scripts/stratified_breakdown.py
- Upstream-drift finding (Sec 5.3): scripts/upstream_drift_check.py ->
  data/results/UPSTREAM-DRIFT-RESULTS.md
- Table 6 (behavioral confirmation): experiments/{anchor}/run_pilot*.py,
  results in each anchor's STAGE2-PILOT-RESULTS.md
- Table 7 (ModelScope check): scripts/build_modelscope_corpus.py ->
